  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-15705\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"15705\" steptype=\"tutorial\" contentid=\"2908\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-15705\" class=\"stepAnchor\" name=\"step-1\">Introduction</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"15705\">?</div>\n            </div> \n\n            <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                            transition: none;\n                            -webkit-transition: none;\n                            -moz-transition: none;\n                            -ms-transition: none;\n                            -o-transition: none\n                            }\n\n                            .mjx-svg-href {\n                            fill: blue;\n                            stroke: blue\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox {\n                            display: table!important\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox span {\n                            display: table-cell!important;\n                            width: 10000em!important;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage__block {\n                            text-align: center;\n                            margin: 1em 0em;\n                            position: relative;\n                            display: block!important;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            width: 100%\n                            }</style><p>A <strong>linear combination</strong> of two vectors <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.299ex\" height=\"1.676ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -576.1 559.5 721.6\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">\\mathbf{a}</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMAINB-61\" d=\"M64 349Q64 399 107 426T255 453Q346 453 402 423T473 341Q478 327 478 310T479 196V77Q493 63 529 62Q549 62 553 57T558 31Q558 9 552 5T514 0H497H481Q375 0 367 56L356 46Q300 -6 210 -6Q130 -6 81 30T32 121Q32 188 111 226T332 272H350V292Q350 313 348 327T337 361T306 391T248 402T194 399H189Q204 376 204 354Q204 327 187 306T134 284Q97 284 81 305T64 349ZM164 121Q164 89 186 67T238 45Q274 45 307 63T346 108L350 117V226H347Q248 218 206 189T164 121Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAINB-61\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> and <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.485ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 639.5 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\\mathbf{b}</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMAINB-62\" d=\"M32 686L123 690Q214 694 215 694H221V409Q289 450 378 450Q479 450 539 387T600 221Q600 122 535 58T358 -6H355Q272 -6 203 53L160 1L129 0H98V301Q98 362 98 435T99 525Q99 591 97 604T83 620Q69 624 42 624H29V686H32ZM227 105L232 99Q237 93 242 87T258 73T280 59T306 49T339 45Q380 45 411 66T451 131Q457 160 457 230Q457 264 456 284T448 329T430 367T396 389T343 398Q282 398 235 355L227 348V105Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAINB-62\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> is a sum of multiples of the two vectors. </p>\n<p>For example, let's consider the vectors <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.299ex\" height=\"1.676ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -576.1 559.5 721.6\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">\\mathbf a</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMAINB-61\" d=\"M64 349Q64 399 107 426T255 453Q346 453 402 423T473 341Q478 327 478 310T479 196V77Q493 63 529 62Q549 62 553 57T558 31Q558 9 552 5T514 0H497H481Q375 0 367 56L356 46Q300 -6 210 -6Q130 -6 81 30T32 121Q32 188 111 226T332 272H350V292Q350 313 348 327T337 361T306 391T248 402T194 399H189Q204 376 204 354Q204 327 187 306T134 284Q97 284 81 305T64 349ZM164 121Q164 89 186 67T238 45Q274 45 307 63T346 108L350 117V226H347Q248 218 206 189T164 121Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAINB-61\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> and <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"2.132ex\" height=\"2.509ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.671ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 918 1080.4\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\">\\mathbf b,</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E4-MJMAINB-62\" d=\"M32 686L123 690Q214 694 215 694H221V409Q289 450 378 450Q479 450 539 387T600 221Q600 122 535 58T358 -6H355Q272 -6 203 53L160 1L129 0H98V301Q98 362 98 435T99 525Q99 591 97 604T83 620Q69 624 42 624H29V686H32ZM227 105L232 99Q237 93 242 87T258 73T280 59T306 49T339 45Q380 45 411 66T451 131Q457 160 457 230Q457 264 456 284T448 329T430 367T396 389T343 398Q282 398 235 355L227 348V105Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E4-MJMAIN-2C\" d=\"M78 35T78 60T94 103T137 121Q165 121 187 96T210 8Q210 -27 201 -60T180 -117T154 -158T130 -185T117 -194Q113 -194 104 -185T95 -172Q95 -168 106 -156T131 -126T157 -76T173 -3V9L172 8Q170 7 167 6T161 3T152 1T140 0Q113 0 96 17Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E4-MJMAINB-62\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E4-MJMAIN-2C\" x=\"639\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> shown below:</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-4348278d5ee116c473f4b742e176a6ff\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/4348278d5ee116c473f4b742e176a6ff\"></div>\n\n\n<p>One particular linear combination of these vectors is \n<span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"23.004ex\" height=\"2.343ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.505ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 9904.3 1008.6\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-5-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-5-Title\">\n\t2 \\mathbf{a} + 3 \\mathbf{b} = 2 \\cdot \\mathbf{a} + 3 \\cdot \\mathbf{b}. \n</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMAIN-32\" d=\"M109 429Q82 429 66 447T50 491Q50 562 103 614T235 666Q326 666 387 610T449 465Q449 422 429 383T381 315T301 241Q265 210 201 149L142 93L218 92Q375 92 385 97Q392 99 409 186V189H449V186Q448 183 436 95T421 3V0H50V19V31Q50 38 56 46T86 81Q115 113 136 137Q145 147 170 174T204 211T233 244T261 278T284 308T305 340T320 369T333 401T340 431T343 464Q343 527 309 573T212 619Q179 619 154 602T119 569T109 550Q109 549 114 549Q132 549 151 535T170 489Q170 464 154 447T109 429Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMAINB-61\" d=\"M64 349Q64 399 107 426T255 453Q346 453 402 423T473 341Q478 327 478 310T479 196V77Q493 63 529 62Q549 62 553 57T558 31Q558 9 552 5T514 0H497H481Q375 0 367 56L356 46Q300 -6 210 -6Q130 -6 81 30T32 121Q32 188 111 226T332 272H350V292Q350 313 348 327T337 361T306 391T248 402T194 399H189Q204 376 204 354Q204 327 187 306T134 284Q97 284 81 305T64 349ZM164 121Q164 89 186 67T238 45Q274 45 307 63T346 108L350 117V226H347Q248 218 206 189T164 121Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMAIN-2B\" d=\"M56 237T56 250T70 270H369V420L370 570Q380 583 389 583Q402 583 409 568V270H707Q722 262 722 250T707 230H409V-68Q401 -82 391 -82H389H387Q375 -82 369 -68V230H70Q56 237 56 250Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMAIN-33\" d=\"M127 463Q100 463 85 480T69 524Q69 579 117 622T233 665Q268 665 277 664Q351 652 390 611T430 522Q430 470 396 421T302 350L299 348Q299 347 308 345T337 336T375 315Q457 262 457 175Q457 96 395 37T238 -22Q158 -22 100 21T42 130Q42 158 60 175T105 193Q133 193 151 175T169 130Q169 119 166 110T159 94T148 82T136 74T126 70T118 67L114 66Q165 21 238 21Q293 21 321 74Q338 107 338 175V195Q338 290 274 322Q259 328 213 329L171 330L168 332Q166 335 166 348Q166 366 174 366Q202 366 232 371Q266 376 294 413T322 525V533Q322 590 287 612Q265 626 240 626Q208 626 181 615T143 592T132 580H135Q138 579 143 578T153 573T165 566T175 555T183 540T186 520Q186 498 172 481T127 463Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMAINB-62\" d=\"M32 686L123 690Q214 694 215 694H221V409Q289 450 378 450Q479 450 539 387T600 221Q600 122 535 58T358 -6H355Q272 -6 203 53L160 1L129 0H98V301Q98 362 98 435T99 525Q99 591 97 604T83 620Q69 624 42 624H29V686H32ZM227 105L232 99Q237 93 242 87T258 73T280 59T306 49T339 45Q380 45 411 66T451 131Q457 160 457 230Q457 264 456 284T448 329T430 367T396 389T343 398Q282 398 235 355L227 348V105Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMAIN-3D\" d=\"M56 347Q56 360 70 367H707Q722 359 722 347Q722 336 708 328L390 327H72Q56 332 56 347ZM56 153Q56 168 72 173H708Q722 163 722 153Q722 140 707 133H70Q56 140 56 153Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMAIN-22C5\" d=\"M78 250Q78 274 95 292T138 310Q162 310 180 294T199 251Q199 226 182 208T139 190T96 207T78 250Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMAIN-2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAINB-61\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-2B\" x=\"1282\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-33\" x=\"2282\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAINB-62\" x=\"2783\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"3700\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"4757\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-22C5\" x=\"5479\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAINB-61\" x=\"5980\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-2B\" x=\"6762\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-33\" x=\"7762\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-22C5\" x=\"8485\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAINB-62\" x=\"8986\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"9625\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>If we draw this linear combination in the coordinate plane, we get the following:</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-dbf1ffb2844fd375523a3362f4be5957\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/dbf1ffb2844fd375523a3362f4be5957\"></div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n        </div>",
